    "original_problem": "Given that $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}\u2061x}{{e}^{2x}},$ find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n| ${y}^{\u2032}$ | $=$ | {{field-1}} |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $x{e}^{2x}$ |",
